      "evidence": [
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(node (ref \"U10\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"A0\") (pintype \"input\")) on net +3.3V"},
        {"source": "spec", "quote": "PWM/servo driver | FCCPeripherals | NXP PCA9685PW (I2C 16-ch PWM), I2C addr 0x40"}
      ],
      "impact": "PCA9685 responds at I2C address 0x41 instead of 0x40, so firmware cannot control the PWM/servo outputs.",
